### List watches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/watches

### Create watch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/watches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ljubljana apartments",
  "searchUrl": "https://www.nepremicnine.net/oglasi-prodaja/ljubljana/stanovanje/",
  "cron": "0 * * * *",
  "isEnabled": true
}

